---
const bad = [
  "Resolved alerts vanish from the UI within minutes",
  "No per-node view of what a box has thrown over time",
  "No record of who or what reached the webhook receiver",
  "State lives in memory, gone on restart",
  "No way to tell a flapping alert from a one-off",
];

const good = [
  "Every status transition logged permanently, or your retention window",
  "Full per-node drilldown: every alert a node has ever thrown",
  "A durable audit log of every ingest attempt, accepted or rejected",
  "SQLite out of the box, Postgres when you outgrow it",
  "Flapping detection surfaced right on the alert",
];
---

<section id="the-gap" class="border-t border-(--color-line) bg-panel py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <h2 class="max-w-2xl text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-paper md:text-4xl">
      The gap Alertmanager leaves open
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-(--color-paper-dim)">
      Alertmanager is excellent at routing and deduplicating alerts in the moment. It was never built to remember
      them. That's a separate job. This is that job.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="card p-7" data-reveal="gap">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-(--color-paper-dim)">Alertmanager alone</h3>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-4">
          {bad.map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-(--color-paper-dim)">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
                <path d="M5 5l10 10M15 5L5 15" />
              </svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-7" data-reveal="gap" style="border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-flame) 35%, var(--color-line))">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-(--color-flame-bright)">With Promhis</h3>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-4">
          {good.map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-paper">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-(--color-flame-bright)" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" />
              </svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
